  "releaseNotes": "10.3.0 (breaking): the entry is written by Jakar.Json's writer, with no System.Text.Json; JakarJsonConsoleFormatterOptions derives from ConsoleFormatterOptions and has Indented and Escaping instead of JsonWriterOptions. Built against Jakar.Json 10.3.0. 10.2.0: built against Jakar.Json 10.2.0, whose writers take a ref TWriter; 10.1.0 calls the removed IBufferWriter overloads and throws MissingMethodException with Jakar.Json 10.2.0. 10.1.0: initial release.",
